Package: novaos-base
Version: @VERSION@
Section: misc
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: NovaOS Project <novaos@localhost>
Depends: base-files, flatpak, ufw, unattended-upgrades, systemd-zram-generator
Recommends: grub-common, novaos-archive-keyring
Description: NovaOS base system configuration
 Identity (os-release), security defaults and system configuration of
 NovaOS, a desktop operating system based on Debian 13 "trixie":
  * os-release / version information
  * Flathub as system-wide Flatpak remote
  * automatic security updates (unattended-upgrades)
  * firewall enabled by default (ufw: deny incoming, allow outgoing)
  * persistent system journal, compressed RAM swap (zram)
  * GRUB theme for the installed system
